  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Seaside - American Dream<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Located in Seaside proper, steps from the beautiful beaches of South Walton and the shops and restaurants of Seaside, American Dream is a spacious slice of Americana. Adorned in red, white, and blue, this patriotic cottage offers architectural details like vaulted ceilings, spiral staircases, and built-in bookcases and benches.<br><br><br><br>American Dream shares running porches and balconies with its sister cottage, Another Dream. Designed much like a townhome, this property features its main living and dining spaces on the second floor with beautiful town views. American Dream's living spaces include a spacious family room with a TV/DVD, a dining space, and a full kitchen. The laundry room and a full bath with a shower complete the main living area.<br><br><br><br>Up the spiral staircase, you'll enjoy the loft space with a trundle bed (sleeps two). Down the spiral staircase are the two nearly identical main guest rooms. Each offers a queen bed, a built-in bench, a TV, and French doors that lead out to the main porch. The second guest bath with a shower separates these two rooms.<br><br><br><br>American Dream offers the very best in Seaside living. Come for the weekend or stay for the month - either way, American Dream is sure to be a dream come true for you and your family and friends!<br><br><br><br>Things to know:<br><br>Free WiFi<br><br>Full kitchen<br><br>*Passes for the fitness center and three community pools are available for purchase, at a rate of $84.00 per day + tax for this home. Passes must be purchased for the entire duration of your stay or not at all - partial passes are not available. Please contact host to purchase passes at the time of booking. Passes must be purchased at least 72 hours prior to your stay.<br><br><br><br>*Wristbands are required to be worn at all times when using seaside amenities. Please provide accurate occupancy when booking. If accurate occupancy is not provided at least one week before your arrival, you may be subject to additional charges.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
